{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Two Players. One Stone. The Ultimate Co-op Challenge.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pyramidion is a <strong>physics-based climbing game</strong> built entirely on <strong>teamwork</strong>. You and a friend must haul a massive stone block from the bottom to the summit. No solo mode. Just you, your partner, and <strong>unforgiving gravity</strong>.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>True Co-op Gameplay</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communication is your best tool. One player uses raw strength, the other clears the path. Sync your movements to survive the climb.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Worker:</strong> Pushes, pulls, and stabilizes the stone.<br></li><li><strong>Foreman:</strong> Guides the way and removes obstacles.</li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/4647d59d90fae84761e0fe9452d2b148.poster.avif?t=1773708377\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/4647d59d90fae84761e0fe9452d2b148.webm?t=1773708377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/4647d59d90fae84761e0fe9452d2b148.mp4?t=1773708377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Physics-Based Simulation</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stone\u2019s weight and momentum feel real. A single mistake or mistimed push can send you sliding back down. It\u2019s a <strong>hard game</strong>, but fair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/e59e4315a704e1c3732de6c4d7672cac.poster.avif?t=1773708377\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/e59e4315a704e1c3732de6c4d7672cac.webm?t=1773708377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/e59e4315a704e1c3732de6c4d7672cac.mp4?t=1773708377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Fall, Recover, Climb Higher</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Failure is part of the experience. <strong>Checkpoints</strong> ensure you never lose total progress, but you must master the mechanics to succeed.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Strategic checkpoints save your journey.<br></li><li>Every retry improves your <strong>coordination</strong>.</li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/ff8f6e3b1fc5c097f7656ce5a19ae116.poster.avif?t=1773708377\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/ff8f6e3b1fc5c097f7656ce5a19ae116.webm?t=1773708377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/ff8f6e3b1fc5c097f7656ce5a19ae116.mp4?t=1773708377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Conquer the Summit</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reaching the top requires patience and strategy. Grab a friend, trust each other, and don't let go of the stone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/e0a830c0ebf534a82721d10abf80c036.poster.avif?t=1773708377\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/e0a830c0ebf534a82721d10abf80c036.webm?t=1773708377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/e0a830c0ebf534a82721d10abf80c036.mp4?t=1773708377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Motivation Will Continue","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4024600/facde0f3f6fb58fe6d1e2631d6611dc539ae9973.jpg"},{"name":"Pharaoh's Penthouse","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4024600/e9a301f8009d856dd3c16720b4ae9541b9946457.jpg"},{"name":"Yeet!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4024600/69013f8c34113773c1cf1a9ae22620f5448716ba.jpg"},{"name":"Apes Together Strong","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4024600/5b63ae236bb90c3214d3f595aff3edf8c60d11cd.jpg"},{"name":"No Pain Rocky!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4024600/37454454419bd714ef44e01429e9f042f72767ef.jpg"},{"name":"Sisyphus Reborn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4024600/fe6bdd8a0dfaf89d00753b8ad6ce844cef08bd11.jpg"},{"name":"Need a Nap?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4024600/fd1b0e34370c68d07728246aa1aa0fd772413567.jpg"},{"name":"With Friends Like These...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4024600/6ffd005f471f311e6686da8e219a0975df18b9b6.jpg"},{"name":"Fragile Cargo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4024600/aebe04be22ee69be5211f3353847611dfa0f1398.jpg"},{"name":"Mummy Dearest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4024600/73ef64465d0ca356d70c9f4297fc04df8313ef79.jpg"}],"total":12},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4024600?t=1773708377","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4024600?t=1773708377","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/82e66b778e7dea33b8a8fe679f23e21f66681d34/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773708377","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/82e66b778e7dea33b8a8fe679f23e21f66681d34/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773708377","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Two Players. One Stone. The Ultimate Co-op Challenge.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pyramidion is a <strong>physics-based climbing game</strong> built entirely on <strong>teamwork</strong>. You and a friend must haul a massive stone block from the bottom to the summit. No solo mode. Just you, your partner, and <strong>unforgiving gravity</strong>.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>True Co-op Gameplay</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communication is your best tool. One player uses raw strength, the other clears the path. Sync your movements to survive the climb.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Worker:</strong> Pushes, pulls, and stabilizes the stone.<br></li><li><strong>Foreman:</strong> Guides the way and removes obstacles.</li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/4647d59d90fae84761e0fe9452d2b148.poster.avif?t=1773708377\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/4647d59d90fae84761e0fe9452d2b148.webm?t=1773708377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/4647d59d90fae84761e0fe9452d2b148.mp4?t=1773708377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Physics-Based Simulation</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stone\u2019s weight and momentum feel real. A single mistake or mistimed push can send you sliding back down. It\u2019s a <strong>hard game</strong>, but fair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/e59e4315a704e1c3732de6c4d7672cac.poster.avif?t=1773708377\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/e59e4315a704e1c3732de6c4d7672cac.webm?t=1773708377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/e59e4315a704e1c3732de6c4d7672cac.mp4?t=1773708377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Fall, Recover, Climb Higher</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Failure is part of the experience. <strong>Checkpoints</strong> ensure you never lose total progress, but you must master the mechanics to succeed.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Strategic checkpoints save your journey.<br></li><li>Every retry improves your <strong>coordination</strong>.</li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/ff8f6e3b1fc5c097f7656ce5a19ae116.poster.avif?t=1773708377\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/ff8f6e3b1fc5c097f7656ce5a19ae116.webm?t=1773708377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/ff8f6e3b1fc5c097f7656ce5a19ae116.mp4?t=1773708377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Conquer the Summit</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reaching the top requires patience and strategy. Grab a friend, trust each other, and don't let go of the stone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/e0a830c0ebf534a82721d10abf80c036.poster.avif?t=1773708377\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/e0a830c0ebf534a82721d10abf80c036.webm?t=1773708377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/e0a830c0ebf534a82721d10abf80c036.mp4?t=1773708377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p>","developers":["TechDevAYDIN"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/ac22ee5845569